    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One morning, your mum wakes you up and takes you to the hospital. The doctor says you are healthy, but you still need to get a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "vaccine",
            "zh": "疫苗"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Why does a healthy "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "person",
            "ref": "v-person"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " need a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "shot",
            "zh": "注射"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Inside your body, you have lots of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "white blood cells",
            "zh": "白细胞"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Just like soldiers, they protect your body from "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "illness",
            "ref": "v-illness"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". When a white blood cell meets an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "invader",
            "zh": "入侵者"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", like a virus or a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "bacterium",
            "zh": "细菌"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", it makes a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "protein",
            "ref": "v-protein"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " called an "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "antibody",
            "zh": "抗体"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The antibody then "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "attacks",
            "zh": "攻击"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the invader."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When you "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "receive",
            "ref": "v-receive"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a vaccine, you are given the virus or bacteria that cause the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "disease",
            "ref": "v-disease"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The virus or bacteria in the vaccine are "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "dead",
            "zh": "灭活的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " or "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "weakened",
            "zh": "减毒的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". That way, your white blood cells are able to make antibodies to fight the disease, and you don’t get sick."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, if the same invader comes into your body again, your antibodies will know how to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fight it off",
            "zh": "击退"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "instruction": "Choose the best answer.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q1",
          "number": 1,
